    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A whistleblower in Sikar, acting as a boundary-crossing informant, sent the National Testing Agency an unexpected signal from the frontier—PDFs matching 100% of the chemistry paper. This forced the testing authority to refer the 26-27 exam personnel to the investigative force. The leak led to the cancellation of the medical entrance exam, a clear result and outcome, and thirteen arrests, including those cornered after the boundary was breached.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.9
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The old map for the NEET-UG examination was invalidated after the leak was exposed. A tipster from an unexpected source on the map provided the leaked exam content, leading to an investigation initiation. Now, a new path opens for the displaced students with a rescheduled exam, offering a second chance to cross the threshold of this gateway examination.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
