    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The leak network was exposed after a truth-seeker uncovered a trail of evidence from the margins of the system. This prompted a referral to the federal investigation agency, resulting in consequences closing in on the network. Among those caught was a former champion, an education advocate now cornered in the very terrain they once sought to reform.",
